(6845905, 1029893, 101256, '<td valign="top">Believe it or not, I''ve actually seen ear rings like this. Unreal. Nicely posed, but again, the half face thing that appears to be a recent technique here is driving me nuts - I hate it.</td>', 'Believe it or not, I''ve actually seen ear rings like this. Unreal. Nicely posed, but again, the half face thing that appears to be a recent technique here is driving me nuts - I hate it.', '2012-08-21 15:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845906, 1030010, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not sure what a beer glove it - is that kind of like a koozy? Anyway, nice color control, pretty good imagery. Well done.</td>', 'Not sure what a beer glove it - is that kind of like a koozy? Anyway, nice color control, pretty good imagery. Well done.', '2012-08-21 15:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845907, 1030045, 101256, '<td valign="top">I know what the photographer was going for here, but just didn''t pull it off. Too bad - it would have been very effective.</td>', 'I know what the photographer was going for here, but just didn''t pull it off. Too bad - it would have been very effective.', '2012-08-21 15:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845910, 1030020, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like it in a Worth1000 kind of way - it is interesting, but I think much too busy to be truly effective. Still, I can''t do this kind of imagery as I''m kind of a putz when it comes to effectively using Photoshop so I''ve got to give points for clearly superior ability using composite imagery. Well done.</td>', 'I like it in a Worth1000 kind of way - it is interesting, but I think much too busy to be truly effective. Still, I can''t do this kind of imagery as I''m kind of a putz when it comes to effectively using Photoshop so I''ve got to give points for clearly superior ability using composite imagery. Well done.', '2012-08-21 15:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845911, 1029865, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''ve either been to this place or I''ve see it on a documentary somewhere. Very interesting image.</td>', 'I''ve either been to this place or I''ve see it on a documentary somewhere. Very interesting image.', '2012-08-21 15:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845913, 1029814, 101256, '<td valign="top">It works, but I think a little more thought into angles, or maybe even a little different framing would have helped it a lot.</td>', 'It works, but I think a little more thought into angles, or maybe even a little different framing would have helped it a lot.', '2012-08-21 15:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
