(6845919, 1029882, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes we come up with this great idea that we think has universal appeal and we spend time producing the image and....yeah, well this is one of those that works, but I would have like to see a little more detail. However, as it is, it is an excellent image. Well done.</td>', 'Sometimes we come up with this great idea that we think has universal appeal and we spend time producing the image and....yeah, well this is one of those that works, but I would have like to see a little more detail. However, as it is, it is an excellent image. Well done.', '2012-08-21 15:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845921, 1029993, 101256, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I''d say that''s about as unusual as it gets alright. :&gt;)</td>', 'Yeah, I''d say that''s about as unusual as it gets alright. :>)', '2012-08-21 15:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845922, 1029657, 101256, '<td valign="top">The question here, as I see it anyway, is this some kind of camera revenge, a statement on the equipment quality or just a general protest? In any case, it''s a great image. Well done and very clever.</td>', 'The question here, as I see it anyway, is this some kind of camera revenge, a statement on the equipment quality or just a general protest? In any case, it''s a great image. Well done and very clever.', '2012-08-21 15:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
