(6846604, 1030013, 141542, '<td valign="top">So after looking over this challenge a few times, I have to say this is my number one pick.  It certainly takes an idea and runs with it, using the full scope of the expert editing rules.  It''s also a classic image, done technically well, with a bit of whimsical emotion about it.<br/> <br/>I like the inclusion of the cat, master of balance, in juxtaposition with this girl who is also a master of balance apparently.<br/> <br/>Good stuff.</td>', 'So after looking over this challenge a few times, I have to say this is my number one pick.  It certainly takes an idea and runs with it, using the full scope of the expert editing rules.  It''s also a classic image, done technically well, with a bit of whimsical emotion about it. I like the inclusion of the cat, master of balance, in juxtaposition with this girl who is also a master of balance apparently. Good stuff.', '2012-08-22 14:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6846606, 1029882, 141542, '<td valign="top">This is my pick for number two.  No matter what manner this was captured in I find it simultaneously haunting, but curious.  It''s a very odd image, and it''s very well put together.  The title, in this case, adds to the image as well.<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'This is my pick for number two.  No matter what manner this was captured in I find it simultaneously haunting, but curious.  It''s a very odd image, and it''s very well put together.  The title, in this case, adds to the image as well. Well done!', '2012-08-22 14:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
