(6848624, 1029775, 141542, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by markwiley:</b></div><hr/><i> 30th place out of 33? That''s crazy. This is a really nice image. I guess some had trouble connecting it well with the challenge theme. Still an excellent shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Mark,<br/> <br/>In the end what I was trying to convey is that advertising, with its ultimate goal of garnering attention to what is, most often, a money-making enterprise, is rarely used for this purpose.  <br/> <br/>Bvy, whose comment I appreciate greatly, was most accurate in saying that it''s an excellent piece of Americana.  I don''t know about excellent, but I certainly intended to share the message that America is not in a great place at the moment, and there is a lot of "sad advertising" going on, as small, family-run businesses like this continue to suffer.<br/> <br/>I didn''t expect the image to do well, but I''m glad it was appreciated by those that understood the message.  Perhaps I just wasn''t blunt enough.<br/> <br/>All the same, thanks to those of you that enjoyed my image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-08-25 09:11:23.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by markwiley: 30th place out of 33? That''s crazy. This is a really nice image. I guess some had trouble connecting it well with the challenge theme. Still an excellent shot.   Thanks Mark, In the end what I was trying to convey is that advertising, with its ultimate goal of garnering attention to what is, most often, a money-making enterprise, is rarely used for this purpose.   Bvy, whose comment I appreciate greatly, was most accurate in saying that it''s an excellent piece of Americana.  I don''t know about excellent, but I certainly intended to share the message that America is not in a great place at the moment, and there is a lot of "sad advertising" going on, as small, family-run businesses like this continue to suffer. I didn''t expect the image to do well, but I''m glad it was appreciated by those that understood the message.  Perhaps I just wasn''t blunt enough. All the same, thanks to those of you that enjoyed my image.', '2012-08-25 10:10:51.000000', '2012-08-25 10:11:23.000000', 0),
