(6849305, 1029882, 41337, '<td valign="top">This photo is absurd <u>yet</u> still manages to convince you of its reality (i.e. the whole point of the craft). It''s unfortunate, but photography is quickly becoming a lost art. The days of a thousand words are pretty much gone. Nowhere is this more evident than this challenge. We awarded three ribbons to photos for their dust jackets alone, while missing out on this novel. Your 20th place finish does nothing more than illustrate the fact that voters are still reading at 3rd grade levels.</td>', 'This photo is absurd yet still manages to convince you of its reality (i.e. the whole point of the craft). It''s unfortunate, but photography is quickly becoming a lost art. The days of a thousand words are pretty much gone. Nowhere is this more evident than this challenge. We awarded three ribbons to photos for their dust jackets alone, while missing out on this novel. Your 20th place finish does nothing more than illustrate the fact that voters are still reading at 3rd grade levels.', '2012-08-26 17:51:03.000000', NULL, 0),
