(6856077, 1029882, 117474, '<td valign="top">Sorry for late notice, but you got the asigmatic:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1000203" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif"/></a></td>', 'Sorry for late notice, but you got the asigmatic:', '2012-09-04 13:19:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6861267, 1030020, 65319, '<td valign="top">The technical aspects of this image far outweigh the core idea which I find rather benign.  I respect <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53147" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Timfythetoo</a> because he dressed himself up as the tooth fairy and didn''t pass this task on to anyone else (especially not his wife).  I''m not suggesting that you dress yourself up as the maid (or am I?!), but I do feel disappointed not to see any twist of imagination here other than in the wings.  And, I do like the wings this time!</td>', 'The technical aspects of this image far outweigh the core idea which I find rather benign.  I respect  Timfythetoo because he dressed himself up as the tooth fairy and didn''t pass this task on to anyone else (especially not his wife).  I''m not suggesting that you dress yourself up as the maid (or am I?!), but I do feel disappointed not to see any twist of imagination here other than in the wings.  And, I do like the wings this time!', '2012-09-10 16:28:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6861280, 1030020, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hihosilver:</b></div><hr/><i>I do feel disappointed not to see any twist of imagination here other than in the wings</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You are right, this really lacks imagination. No concept at all, no idea, no nothing (except the wings, of course). I am starting to do landscapes from now on. Or flowers, we''ll see.</td>', 'Originally posted by hihosilver:I do feel disappointed not to see any twist of imagination here other than in the wings  You are right, this really lacks imagination. No concept at all, no idea, no nothing (except the wings, of course). I am starting to do landscapes from now on. Or flowers, we''ll see.', '2012-09-10 16:41:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6863547, 1030020, 65319, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gyaban:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hihosilver:</b></div><hr/><i>I do feel disappointed not to see any twist of imagination here other than in the wings</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You are right, this really lacks imagination. No concept at all, no idea, no nothing (except the wings, of course). I am starting to do landscapes from now on. Or flowers, we''ll see. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Mmmmm...You are right too in that I should mind my manners more than my opinion.  No matter what "escape" you find in any future "landscape"...I do hope you surprise your lovely wife daily with the flowers she deserves.  Photograph them if you wish...or not.  ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by gyaban: Originally posted by hihosilver:I do feel disappointed not to see any twist of imagination here other than in the wings  You are right, this really lacks imagination. No concept at all, no idea, no nothing (except the wings, of course). I am starting to do landscapes from now on. Or flowers, we''ll see.   Mmmmm...You are right too in that I should mind my manners more than my opinion.  No matter what "escape" you find in any future "landscape"...I do hope you surprise your lovely wife daily with the flowers she deserves.  Photograph them if you wish...or not.  ;-)', '2012-09-14 09:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
